---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /404.html
title: "Page not found · Viral Templates"
description: "That page isn't here. The game templates, the asset packs and the contact form all still are. Pick one of the links below."
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<section class="notfound">
  <div class="well">
    <div class="page-head">
    <h1 class="display">That page isn't here.</h1>
    <p class="sub" style="margin-top: var(--s-6); max-width: 52ch">
      The link is either old or mistyped. Everything we sell is two clicks away.
    </p>

    </div>
    <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: var(--s-10); justify-content: center">
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/templates/">
        Browse all game templates and asset packs
        <svg class="btn__arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
             stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/">Back to the home page</a>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: var(--s-16)">
      <h2 class="footer__heading">Or go straight to a product</h2>
      <ul class="footer__list">
        {%- for p in products %}
        <li><a href="/{{ p.slug }}/">{{ p.name }}, ${{ p.priceNow | money }}</a></li>
        {%- endfor %}
        <li><a href="/contact/">Contact us</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
